#### Module Federation Remote Entry URL Management

```json
// public/importmap.json
{
  "imports": {
    "shell": "https://cdn.gainwell.com/shell/v1.3.0/remoteEntry.js",
    "claims": "https://cdn.gainwell.com/claims/v2.1.0/remoteEntry.js",
    "provider": "https://cdn.gainwell.com/provider/v1.8.5/remoteEntry.js"
  }
}
```

Independent module updates:

- Claims module updates v2.1.0 → v2.1.1 (bug fix)
- Provider module stays on v1.8.5 (no changes)
- Shell updates importmap.json to point to new Claims URL
